*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_KPI_PM_Counters_benchmarking
    [Documentation]  Purpose of this test case is to verify KPIs and PMs counters values generated during L3 Call procedure,
    ...              by comparing previous run values with current one using Scout Comparator tool. This test requires SCF
    ...              with BARRED cell except the one user want to perform L3 Call procedure on.
    ...              Please check ${start_point_generation} param note for properly executing this test for the first
    ...              time on given BTs.
    ...
    ...              ARGS:
    ...              - cell_id     - Config ID of the cell that L3 call operation will be performed on.
    ...              - cell_type   - RAT type of called cell: 'nr' or 'lte'
    ...              - scout_tl_name - name of BTS in Scout Tool, e.g. 10_16_40703-50703_MRBTS-40703
    ...              - scout_template_id - id of template that user what to use in Scout Comparator report
    ...              - scf_file_path - path to scf with BARRED cells
    ...              - throughput  - dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                              it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells.
    ...                              Example:
    ...                              {
    ...                                  '827736065':
    ...                                       {
    ...                                           'throughput':
    ...                                               {
    ...                                                   'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                   'uplink': '0 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                               },
    ...                                           'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                       },
    ...                              }
    ...               - direction - direction of the data transfer: `UL`, `DL`, `UL_DL`; defaults to DL.
    ...               - protocol - data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...               - udp_buffer - monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...               - linux_congestion: option "-Z" for iperf2. TCP congestion algorithm (Linux and FreeBSD only)
    ...                                   to check supported algorithms use `sysctl net.ipv4.tcp_available_congestion_control` command
    ...               - cycles - number of full quarter cycles counted starting from the nearest quarter, e.g. there's 11:10, and it's
    ...                          5 minutes before quarter 11:15, so for 3 cycles starting counting at quarter 15 the ending quarter
    ...                          will be 12:00
    ...               - alpha - the alpha index, used in the t-test calculation, e.g. 0.005
    ...               - start_point_generation - used to generate starting point for future test. Use it if:
    ...                                          * it's first time using test for given BTS
    ...                                          * user wants to change ${scout_template_id} param and it's first time
    ...                                            being used on given BTS
    ...               - ignored_cells_on_preparation - SHOULD BE USED WITH `prepare_cells_to_call` set to True!
    ...                                               list of cells CONFIGURATION distnames that should be ignored during
    ...                                               L3 Call not called cells preparation procedure and not be blocked/barred
    ...               - custom_base_scf_path - a custom path to the SCF file which will be activated in the teardown
    ...               - tc_name - name of the test case, used for storing data in database (useful when you want to 
    ...                           execute test multiple times on the same BTS with different configuration),
    ...                           defaults to General_SiSo_KPI_PM_Counters_benchmarking
    [Arguments]                                     ${cell_id}
    ...                                             ${cell_type}
    ...                                             ${scout_tl_name}
    ...                                             ${scout_template_id}
    ...                                             ${scf_file_path}
    ...                                             ${throughput}
    ...                                             ${direction}=DL
    ...                                             ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                             ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                             ${linux_congestion}=${None}
    ...                                             ${cycles}=1
    ...                                             ${alpha}=0.005
    ...                                             ${start_point_generation}=${False}
    ...                                             ${ignored_cells_on_preparation}=${None}
    ...                                             ${custom_base_scf_path}=${None}
    ...                                             ${tc_name}=General_SiSo_KPI_PM_Counters_benchmarking

    ${bts_type}=                                    hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    Perform commissioning and achieve On Air        scf_file_path=${scf_file_path}
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${connection}                                   connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${sw_version}=                                  admin.get_sw_version
    ...                                             connection=${connection}
    ${cell_dist_names}                              admin_info_model.get_dist_names_for_specific_cell
    ...                                             connection=${connection}
    ...                                             cell_type=${cell_type}
    ...                                             cell_id=${cell_id}
    ${call_duration}=                               Evaluate  (${cycles}*15+5)*60

    benchmarking_db.setup                           connection=${connection}
    ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${record_exists}=                               benchmarking_db.check_if_record_exists_for_bts
    ...                                             tc_name=${tc_name}
    ...                                             template_id=${scout_template_id}
    ...                                             cycles=${cycles}
    Run Keyword If                                  not ${start_point_generation} and not ${record_exists}
    ...                                             Fail  No data found in database for TL: ${scout_tl_name}, template ID: ${scout_template_id} and cycles: ${cycles}. Please rerun test manually with flag `start_point_generation` set to True to generate start point.

    Robot Log Operation                             Waiting 5 minutes before next quarter to start L3 Call procedure...
    wait.wait_until_minutes_before_next_quarter     minutes=5
    Start L3 Call In Background                     called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                             direction=${direction}
    ...                                             duration=${call_duration}s
    ...                                             throughputs=${throughput}
    ...                                             protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                             udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                             linux_congestion=${linux_congestion}
    ...                                             prepare_cells_to_call=${False}
    ...                                             ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}
    ${start_datetime}=                              wait.wait_until_next_quarter
    ...                                             return_with_timezone=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                             Waiting ${cycles} full quarter cycles to generate PM counters data...
    ${end_datetime}=                                wait.wait_full_quarter_cycles
    ...                                             cycles=${cycles}
    ...                                             return_with_timezone=${True}
    Verify Background L3 Call Results               called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}

    Robot Log Operation                             Waiting for data to be available on Scout...
    wait.wait_until_next_hour
    Sleep                                           10min

    Run Keyword If                                  ${record_exists} and not ${start_point_generation}
    ...                                             Generate and Verify Scout report
    ...                                             scout_tl_name=${scout_tl_name}
    ...                                             tc_name=${tc_name}
    ...                                             template_id=${scout_template_id}
    ...                                             start_datetime=${start_datetime}
    ...                                             end_datetime=${end_datetime}
    ...                                             cycles=${cycles}
    ...                                             sw_version=${sw_version}
    ...                                             alpha=${alpha}
    benchmarking_db.save_datetime_for_bts           tc_name=${tc_name}
    ...                                             template_id=${scout_template_id}
    ...                                             start_datetime=${start_datetime}
    ...                                             end_datetime=${end_datetime}
    ...                                             cycles=${cycles}

    [Teardown]                                      Run Keywords
    ...                                             benchmarking_db.disconnect
    ...                                             AND
    ...                                             Restore Base SCF    custom_base_scf_path=${custom_base_scf_path}

Generate and Verify Scout report
    [Arguments]                                     ${scout_tl_name}
    ...                                             ${tc_name}
    ...                                             ${template_id}
    ...                                             ${start_datetime}
    ...                                             ${end_datetime}
    ...                                             ${cycles}
    ...                                             ${sw_version}
    ...                                             ${alpha}

    Robot Log Operation                             Fetching last run data from db and triggering Scout report generation...
    ${db_record_data}=                              benchmarking_db.read_data_for_bts
    ...                                             tc_name=${tc_name}
    ...                                             template_id=${template_id}
    ...                                             cycles=${cycles}

    ${report_id}=                                   scout_comparator.trigger_report_generation
    ...                                             scout_tl_name=${scout_tl_name}
    ...                                             template_id=${template_id}
    ...                                             reference_start_time=${db_record_data["start_datetime"]}
    ...                                             reference_end_time=${db_record_data["end_datetime"]}
    ...                                             first_period_description=${db_record_data["sw_version"]}
    ...                                             current_start_time=${start_datetime}
    ...                                             current_end_time=${end_datetime}
    ...                                             second_period_description=${sw_version}
    ...                                             alpha=${alpha}

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer         5min
    ...                                             15s
    ...                                             Validate Scout Report Is Ready
    ...                                             report_id=${report_id}
    scout_comparator.validate_report                report_id=${report_id}
    Robot Log Result                                Scout report validated successfully!
    ...                                             to_console=${True}

Validate Scout Report Is Ready
    [Arguments]                                     ${report_id}
    ${report_ready}=                                scout_comparator.validate_report_calculation_successful
    ...                                             report_id=${report_id}
    Run Keyword If                                  not ${report_ready}
    ...                                             Fail  msg=Report is not ready for validation

Restore Base SCF
    [Arguments]                                     ${custom_base_scf_path}=${None}
    IF    '${custom_base_scf_path}' != '${None}'
        Perform recommissioning    path_to_scf=${custom_base_scf_path}
    ELSE
        Perform recommissioning to base SCF
    END
